      "mergedPostDetails": "Good evening, since I just came from a 3hr Session of pulling my Hair out why my Avatar wouldn't upload, it would be cool if the SDK gave me an Error that I have the wrong SDK Version since 3.10.x is mandatory now.\n\nBut when trying to upload with an outdated Version of the SDK it just gives me.\n\n\"Failed to upload\" (Unity.Null.Pointer.Reference)\n\nAs someone that somewhat knows how to read a Console and Errors, that doesn't help me at all to troubleshoot what is wrong with my Avatar.",
